      "id": "b1",
      "kind": "page",
      "level": null,
      "style": null,
      "text": "SAFFIRE-II\nImage Directory Nomenclature\nVersion 3.0\nXnCn_Raw_CamOriginal Camera original RAW files recorded on-board and downlinked on command.\nContains 8-byte offset that must be processed prior to color interpolation and\ndistribution. This data set is archived at NASA-GRC.\nXnCn_Raw_DistroMaster RAW Camara Orginal files processed for 8-byte offset using ImageJ, and resaved\nusing originial file name. This is the RAW Distribution Master set for Science Team\ndistribution and color interpolation (demosaicing).\nXn_Raw2TIFF TIFF images of the RAW Distribution Master files, color interpolated (demosaiced)\nusing IrfanView Batch Conversion process.\nXn_Raw2TIFF_icmad Raw2TIFF files annotated with ICMAD 'Exposure' and 'Gain' information. Data is\nappended to the bottom of each frame using ImageMagick script and resaved as\nTIFF.\nXn_jpeg Jpeg images created on-board SAFFIRE payload and downlinked by command\nXn_jpeg_corrupt Jpeg images received corrupted after downlink.\nXn_jpeg2png_icmad Jpeg images annotated with ICMAD 'Exposure' and 'Gain' information. Data is\nappended to the bottom of each frame using ImageMagick script and re-saved as\n.png format to minimize additional compression artifacts.\n\"Xn\" Denotes run type and number\n\"Cn\" Denotes camera number (if sorted separately)\nPage 1 of 2",
      "location": {
        "page": 1
      }
    },
